---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Python Cheat Sheet | Free Syntax, Data Structures & OOP"
  description="Complete Python cheat sheet with syntax, data structures, OOP, and common patterns. Free download for beginners and advanced programmers."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Python<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Essential syntax, data structures, OOP, and common patterns. From basics to advanced.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Variables & Data Types</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Basic Types</h3>
        <pre><code>x = 42          # int
y = 3.14        # float
s = "hello"     # str
b = True        # bool
n = None        # NoneType</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Containers</h3>
        <pre><code>lst = [1, 2, 3]        # list
tup = (1, 2, 3)        # tuple
s = &#123;1, 2, 3&#125;          # set
d = &#123;"a"&#58; 1, "b"&#58; 2&#125;   # dict</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Control Flow</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Conditionals</h3>
        <pre><code>if x > 0&#58;
    positive
elif x == 0&#58;
    zero
else&#58;
    negative</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Loops</h3>
        <pre><code>for i in range(10)&#58;
    print(i)

while x > 0&#58;
    x -= 1</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Functions</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Basic Function</h3>
        <pre><code>def greet(name, greeting="Hello")&#58;
    return f"&#123;greeting&#125;, &#123;name&#125;!"</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Lambda</h3>
        <pre><code>square = lambda x&#58; x ** 2
add = lambda a, b&#58; a + b</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>List Comprehensions</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Basic</h3>
        <pre><code>squares = [x**2 for x in range(10)]
evens = [x for x in range(10) if x % 2 == 0]</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Dictionary</h3>
        <pre><code>squares_dict = &#123;x&#58; x**2 for x in range(10)&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>OOP</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Class Definition</h3>
        <pre><code>class Dog&#58;
    def __init__(self, name)&#58;
        self.name = name
    
    def bark(self)&#58;
        return f"&#123;self.name&#125; says woof!"</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Inheritance</h3>
        <pre><code>class Puppy(Dog)&#58;
    def bark(self)&#58;
        return f"&#123;self.name&#125; says yap!"</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
